          "end": 2277.61,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " people",
          "start": 2277.61,
          "end": 2277.93,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " are",
          "start": 2277.93,
          "end": 2278.27,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " talking",
          "start": 2278.27,
          "end": 2279.53,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " rumors.",
          "start": 2279.53,
          "end": 2280.57,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And that if we sit with them, we are just as guilty and that we should get up and leave.",
      "start": 2280.91,
      "end": 2285.18,
      "speaker": "A woman",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " And",
