          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " years.",
          "start": 2462.37,
          "end": 2462.92,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, they grew to about maybe 25 or 30 people.",
