        },
        {
          "word": " people.",
          "start": 2466.11,
          "end": 2466.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, they thought they were getting too strong, so they banished them out of Mecca, boycotted them.",
