          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " abused.",
          "start": 2474.83,
          "end": 2475.53,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, those have to have a special place in Heaven.",
      "start": 2477.51,
      "end": 2482.19,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
