          "word": " myself.",
          "start": 3290.99,
          "end": 3291.49,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For a long time, I said \"it couldn't be just us here worshipping God alone. There must be millions in the world.\"",
