          "speaker": "Naghmeh"
        },
        {
          "word": " of...",
          "start": 5301.97,
          "end": 5302.15,
          "speaker": "Naghmeh"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If anybody sees that who does not believe in God...",
